# lr4-broker ACL (docs/litter-robot.md). Usernames are certificate CNs
# (use_identity_as_username). Serials never appear here: they are only in the
# robots' certificates.

# Each Litter-Robot (CN = its serial): its own subtree only. It publishes
# prod/LR4/<serial>/state and /activity and subscribes to /command.
pattern readwrite prod/LR4/%u/#

# The whiskerless CLI identity (Vault pki/whiskerless/cli), for status,
# monitor and calibrate from a laptop. Commands still pass the CLI's own
# safety guard.
user whiskerless-cli
topic readwrite prod/LR4/#
